  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「清水の舞台から市街も見下ろせたぞお、京都ってすごいな！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「ほんとに碁盤目状になってるんだなあ～っ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「早く町中をキャッキャ☆ウフフと駆け巡りたいぞお！」"
